          item-159 at level 5: text: -1
          item-160 at level 5: text: ) in manure. The daily VS was estimated as proposed by Eugène et al. [44] as: VS = NDOMI + (UE × GE) × (OM/18.45), where: VS = volatile solid excretion on an organic matter (OM) basis (kg day
          item-161 at level 5: text: -1
          item-162 at level 5: text: ), NDOMI = non-digestible OM intake (kg day
